   "header": "<h1> Technical Data »titanium« </h1>",
   "body": "<figure><table><tbody><tr><td>Maximum tool length Z 600 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum tool diameter D 230/100 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum groove gauge diameter d 100/75 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Number of axes 5-7</td></tr><tr><td>Weight ~ 1400 kg</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>",
